
# I'm trying to keep the "AI-Generated" mods out of this pack. Ashen's mods in particular block the deletion of their folders (somehow).
# "AI-Assisted" mods are fine, I just don't want slop to infest this pack.

# I draw a hard line against any DLL mods from REX due to his behavior. If a mod depends on a Rex DLL mod, that mod wont be here.
# As far as I can tell, all of his DLL mods are "safe", but I don't trust that to stay the case.

